BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 522.00 Td (A window holds at most 512 tokenizer tokens, including the leading beginning-of-sequence token. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 509.00 Td (development pass is 1619 such windows and 564,349 tokenizer tokens. Each of those windows has exactly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 496.00 Td (one leading BOS. That token has an empty character offset and is not pooled. EOS, PAD, UNK, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 483.00 Td (multimodal special counts on that tokenizer-only census were 0. The census is docs/special_tokens.txt.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 470.00 Td (It did not load weights.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 453.00 Td (Each subword is assigned to the whitespace token it overlaps most. An equal overlap stays on the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 440.00 Td (earlier token. After the windows of one side are stitched, the submitted Tier-1 Combination applies) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 427.00 Td (four deterministic steps: \(1\) subtract 0.50 times the document's mean subword vector to remove) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 414.00 Td (causal-decoder anisotropy; \(2\) compute cross-lingual cosine similarity with bidirectional Cross-Domain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 401.00 Td (Similarity Local Scaling \(CSLS, alpha = 0.50, k = 5 nearest neighbors\) to suppress hub subwords; \(3\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 388.00 Td (blend global best cosine \(0.65\) with sentence-constrained best cosine \(0.35\) restricted to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 375.00 Td (best-matching sentence +/- 1 on the other side; and \(4\) pool clamp\(1 - similarity, 0, 1\) across) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 362.00 Td (subwords within each whitespace token, followed by window-2 triangular span smoothing across) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 349.00 Td (non-punctuation tokens, rounded to 6 decimals.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 332.00 Td (Encoder lines contain only id, text_a, text_b, labels_a, and labels_b. Every label is in [0, 1]. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 48.00 319.00 Td (writer rejects -1 and NaN. The label count equals the whitespace-token count. Generated tokens are 0,) Tj ET
